      "description": "{ \"status\": \"APPROVED\", \"prooflevel\": \"DOCUMENTATION HASH FIXTURES ONLY; no RocksDB execution, crash or replay tests performed; isolated encoding examples, not a complete business transition trace\", \"commands\": [ { \"schemaversion\": \"london.v1\", \"commandid\": \"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111\", \"commandtype\": \"CloseDay\", \"actorid\": \"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222\", \"admittedatms\": \"87000000\",.",
