      "description": "Porto Whitepaper This repository contains the canonical Porto whitepaper: \"Porto: A Network-Owned Infrastructure Layer for Music Distribution.\" Porto is decentralized streaming infrastructure that replaces platform-owned delivery and settlement with a network run by artists, labels, publishers, and independent node operators. Every play is logged on Porto Chain, a purpose-built blockchain, and settled automatically.",
